ts in the sewer. <br><br>Press the buttons, collect the items and unlock the escape. Just don't get caught by Mr Snotty or his friends...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435890/extras/b7741e84f7d6eaceff69d21244627859.poster.avif?t=1714387252\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2435890/extras/b7741e84f7d6eaceff69d21244627859.webm?t=1714387252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
